# The open-marker guard dropped: the owner advances while a hand-off is open,
# past a foreign entry no close has yet recorded.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestNoOpenCheck
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the owner advances live while a hand-off marker is open
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance

--- FIND
    /\ ~MarkerOpen(a)
    /\ rp[a] >= MarkerClosedAt(a) - 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the open marker is not consulted.
    /\ rp[a] >= MarkerClosedAt(a) - 1
--- END
